Garmin refuses the food search of an account without Garmin Connect+ with 403 ForbiddenException. The message names the plan, and the exit code stays 1 (error) with status 403.
-- args --
nutrition
favorites
add
1001
--query
apple
-- route GET /nutrition-service/food/search?searchExpression=apple&start=0&limit=50 403 noeol --
{"message":"HTTP 403 Forbidden","error":"ForbiddenException"}
-- table stdout --
-- table stderr --
find food: this needs a Garmin Connect+ subscription (403 Forbidden)
-- table exit --
1
-- table requests --
GET /nutrition-service/food/search?searchExpression=apple&start=0&limit=50
